- **Zarathustra Brady**, *Poisson imitators and sieve theory*, author’s note, §§1–2, especially Theorem 2. This explains the moment-problem/sieve-weight duality relevant to the level barrier. [Author PDF](https://www.notzeb.com/poisson-imitators.pdf).
