**Proved:** a fourth-moment argument improves the coverage bound to
\[
\frac{\#\{(p,q)\in S_n:\text{uncovered}\}}{|S_n|}
\ll \frac{n^4}{H^4}
\]
in the parameter ranges relevant here. Consequently, \(N^{-\varepsilon}\) coverage exceptions require only \(H\asymp nN^{\varepsilon/4}\), giving cost
